"菜谱数据会同步到云端吗？" = "Are my recipes synced to the cloud?";
"不会。菜谱默认保存在设备本地；使用识图功能时，只有你主动选择的图片会用于生成菜谱建议。" = "No. Recipes are stored locally on your device. When you use image recognition, only the photo you select is used to generate recipe suggestions.";
"为什么识别结果偶尔不准确？" = "Why are recognition results sometimes inaccurate?";
"光线、遮挡、菜品摆放和图片清晰度都会影响识别。你可以在保存前手动修改名称、配料、步骤和备注。" = "Lighting, obstructions, presentation, and image quality can affect recognition. You can edit the name, ingredients, steps, and notes before saving.";
"如何备份我的菜谱？" = "How do I back up my recipes?";
"在设置里的“备份我的菜谱”中分享 JSON 备份文件，可以保存到文件 App、iCloud Drive 或发送给自己。" = "Use Back Up My Recipes in Settings to share a JSON backup. You can save it to Files, iCloud Drive, or send it to yourself.";
"如何反馈问题或建议？" = "How do I report a problem or suggestion?";
"在设置里点击 Support and Feedback，会打开邮件并自动带上 App 版本信息。" = "Tap Support and Feedback in Settings to open an email that includes the app version.";

